---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us — All Calc Kit" 
  description="Learn about All Calc Kit—the free, high-performance online calculator and unit converter platform engineered for speed, privacy, and zero latency."
  canonicalUrl="https://allcalckit.com/about"
>
  <!-- Hero Header -->
  <section class="border-b border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 bg-neutral-50/50 dark:bg-neutral-950/50 py-12 sm:py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <!-- Breadcrumb -->
      <nav class="flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono text-neutral-500 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-black dark:hover:text-white transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span>/</span>
        <span class="text-black dark:text-white font-semibold">About Us</span>
      </nav>

      <div class="space-y-4">
        <span class="px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 font-mono text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider inline-block">
          Our Mission & Vision
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-bold tracking-tight text-black dark:text-white">
          About All Calc Kit.
        </h1>
        <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-300 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl font-medium">
          Reinventing daily calculations through high-speed, distraction-free, and privacy-focused web tools.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Main Content Body -->
  <section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 py-12 sm:py-16 space-y-12 text-neutral-700 dark:text-neutral-300">
    
    <!-- Philosophy Grid -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-6">
      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-blue-500/10 text-blue-600 dark:text-blue-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">⚡</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white text-base">Zero Latency</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Calculations process client-side directly in your browser, yielding instantaneous sub-5ms results without server lag.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-emerald-500/10 text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">🔒</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white text-base">Privacy First</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          Your personal data, health inputs, and financial figures are never stored or tracked. Everything stays private on your device.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="bg-white dark:bg-neutral-900/60 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 space-y-3">
        <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-xl bg-purple-500/10 text-purple-600 dark:text-purple-400 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-lg">✨</div>
        <h3 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white text-base">Zero Distractions</h3>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400 leading-relaxed">
          No pop-up ads, paywalls, mandatory account logins, or unnecessary clicks. Pure calculation utility at your fingertips.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Article Content -->
    <div class="space-y-6 text-sm leading-relaxed">
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white tracking-tight">Why We Built All Calc Kit</h2>
      <p>
        The modern web is filled with calculation websites cluttered with aggressive advertisements, slow page reloads, mandatory registration walls, and invasive tracking scripts. Finding a simple tool to convert temperature, split a restaurant bill, or calculate mortgage interest often requires navigating through heavy, distracting websites.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>All Calc Kit</strong> was built to solve tab sprawl and web bloat by bringing over 40 essential calculators and converters into one clean, responsive, and unified hub.
      </p>

      <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-black dark:text-white tracking-tight mt-10">Our Tool Categories</h2>
      <p>
        Whether you are an engineer converting pressure units, a homeowner planning loan amortization, a student testing prime numbers, or a home cook scaling a recipe, All Calc Kit has tailored tools designed specifically for your needs:
      </p>

      <ul class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 pt-2 text-xs font-mono">
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-500"></span>
          <span>Unit Converters (Length, Weight, Temp, Volume)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-emerald-500"></span>
          <span>Currency & Finance (Forex, EMI, SIP, Tax, Tip)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></span>
          <span>Health & Fitness (BMI, BMR, TDEE, Water Intake)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-purple-500"></span>
          <span>Math & Numbers (Percentage, Base, Prime)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-amber-500"></span>
          <span>Date & Time (Date Diff, Unix Epoch)</span>
        </li>
        <li class="p-3 bg-neutral-100 dark:bg-neutral-900 rounded-xl border border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-2.5 h-2.5 rounded-full bg-indigo-500"></span>
          <span>Text & Encoding (Word Counter, Case, Color)</span>
        </li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <!-- Call to Action -->
    <div class="pt-8 border-t border-neutral-200 dark:border-neutral-800 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
      <div>
        <h4 class="font-bold text-black dark:text-white text-base">Have a tool suggestion?</h4>
        <p class="text-xs text-neutral-600 dark:text-neutral-400">We continuously build new converters and calculators based on user requests.</p>
      </div>
      <a href="/contact" class="px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-black dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-black font-semibold text-xs hover:opacity-90 transition-opacity whitespace-nowrap">
        Contact Our Team →
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
